WEBVTT

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:03.960
Aww...

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:06.550
Today's quiz killed me.

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:09.230
Before it even started, I already gave up.

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:11.140
Pop quizzes are rough.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.450
They don't do them at my school.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:17.090
How about you, Na-chan? Was it okay?

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:18.480
Of course not.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.430
Still...

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:21.310
Still?

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:23.520
Hey, Yukirin!

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:25.650
Did Kobayakawa-san say anything?

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:27.560
Like what?

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:30.650
Like, I don't know... she looked down.

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:33.160
She did seem a bit out of it earlier.

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:36.010
But she didn't say anything to us.

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:37.240
I see...

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:40.960
<i>If she didn't say anything...</i>

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:42.740
<i>...l guess it's okay.</i>

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:49.840
<i>Still... I really am worried.</i>

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:50.980
Na-chan?

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:52.540
That's my cola, you know.

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:53.850
Ack! Sorry!

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:01.970
Now I really do have work.

00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:02.940
Geez.

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:05.660
It is pretty sudden, but I'll go in.

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:07.570
Sorry.

00:01:07.570 --> 00:01:08.440
Okay.

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:09.900
Take care.

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:44.300
Good work today.

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:45.910
You, too.

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:47.490
Thanks for helping out.

00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:52.170
<i>I'm kind of exhausted.</i>

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:54.200
<i>It was pretty busy for a weekday.</i>

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:59.310
<i>But I'm glad I really did have work today.</i>

00:02:59.310 --> 00:03:03.480
<i>Whenever I'm working,
I don't have to think about other things.</i>

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:06.320
<i>Maybe I'll ask for more shifts.</i>

00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:14.120
<i>They've already left...</i>

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:16.140
<i>I'll head home.</i>

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:20.840
<i>But I did ditch them in the first place... I'm being weird.</i>

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:27.630
Hey.

00:03:27.630 --> 00:03:28.940
Hello.

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:31.300
<i>A train is arriving on Platform 2.</i>

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:33.760
<i>Please stand back for your own safety.
It's one coincidence after another.</i>

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:35.710
On your way home from work?

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:37.380
Yeah.

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.030
You're alone, Naoe-kun?

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:39.600
Yeah.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:42.110
I walked Yukirin home.

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:43.210
I see.

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:54.370
That reminds me, Na-chan was worried.

00:03:54.730 --> 00:03:57.200
He said you looked down.

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:07.050
Hashiba-kun's a good guy...

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:08.530
Na-chan?

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:09.730
Hm...

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:11.970
Maybe not so much that...

00:04:11.970 --> 00:04:15.000
But he is an amusing idiot.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.140
An idiot?

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:21.350
You know, how his emotions show
on his face. He's easy to read.

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:23.540
It's pretty funny to watch.

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:25.270
You never get tired of it.

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:30.280
That's true.

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:36.030
Well, if I'm being serious,

00:04:36.390 --> 00:04:40.700
he's an unusually earnest and hardworking guy.

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:44.210
Not just that,
it's fun just being around him.

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:48.160
That's what I'd say, as his friend.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:50.590
<i>I was right.</i>

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:52.720
<i>Hashiba-kun is a good guy.</i>

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:52.930
<i>Disembark on the right-hand side.
Hashiba-kun is a good guy.</i>

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:54.450
<i>Disembark on the right-hand side.</i>

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:55.780
Well?

00:04:55.780 --> 00:04:57.880
Was any of that helpful?

00:04:57.880 --> 00:04:59.910
Yes, thank you.

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:00.620
<i>But...</i>

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:01.770
Ah.

00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:02.930
This is my stop.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:11.900
Don't tell anybody about what I just said.
They'll just joke about it.

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:12.340
Later.

00:05:12.340 --> 00:05:13.960
Okay, I won't.

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:21.850
<i>A friend who's fun to be around...</i>

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:24.280
<i>That's right.</i>

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:26.670
<i>They're all my friends, and good people.</i>

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:30.200
<i>There's Mari-chan, Yukirin, and Nozomi-chan...</i>

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:33.370
<i>...and also Naoe-kun,
Matsunaga-kun, and Katakura-kun.</i>

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:39.640
<i>But... Hashiba-kun is a bit different than the others.</i>

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:43.640
<i>Now my thoughts are even messier.</i>

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:48.060
<i>I was hoping to find an answer
quickly so I could feel at ease...</i>

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:51.530
<i>It seems like everyone's worried about me.</i>

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:52.940
<i>Mari-chan was.</i>

00:05:52.940 --> 00:05:55.490
<i>Naoe-kun was too, I'm sure.</i>

00:05:55.820 --> 00:05:59.530
<i>Oh right, Mari-chan!
She's been kissed before.</i>

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.630
<i>I never knew that.</i>

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:03.900
<i>When was it? Who did it?</i>

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:08.580
<i>But she didn't like it, so I can't really ask her about it.</i>

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:10.540
<i>Didn't like...</i>

00:06:11.030 --> 00:06:12.300
<i>Huh?</i>

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:15.970
<i>But I didn't dislike it...</i>

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:17.590
<i>I wonder why.</i>

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:20.010
<i>I was surprised.</i>

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:22.200
<i>And I panicked a bit after.</i>

00:06:23.140 --> 00:06:26.030
<i>I wasn't calm enough to think about it much.</i>

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:29.650
<i>But, now, when I think back about it.</i>

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:34.750
<i>I don't think I disliked it or felt angry that it happened.</i>

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:38.570
<i>Maybe I'm just weird.</i>

00:06:42.390 --> 00:06:43.880
<i>Was that my phone?</i>

00:06:46.480 --> 00:06:47.650
<i>Hashiba-kun.</i>

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:51.930
<i>How should I reply?</i>

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:56.670
<i>He's sending an image.</i>

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:01.590
<i>It's a four-leaf clover.</i>

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:09.340
<i>Hashiba-kun's the one I'm agonizing over,</i>

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:11.830
<i>but this calms me down. That's not fair.</i>

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:20.660
<i>They found it together.
By the riverbed, maybe?</i>

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:22.530
<i>That must have been fun.</i>

00:07:22.530 --> 00:07:24.570
I can't find any!

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:25.610
Not this one.

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:26.800
It's too hot.

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:29.140
The one who finds it is a hero.

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:32.780
<i>I wish I could have searched with them.</i>

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:37.220
<i>Actually, I really wanted to talk with all of them today.</i>

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:38.700
<i>With all of them?</i>

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:39.830
<i>But who...?</i>

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:42.860
I found one!

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:45.220
<i>Who did I really want to see?</i>

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:47.630
<i>I wanted to see him.</i>

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:53.650
<i>It's my first time like this, and I don't know what to do.</i>

00:07:54.730 --> 00:07:57.510
<i>Honestly, I wish someone could just tell me.</i>

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:00.440
<i>But that won't work.</i>

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:03.850
<i>Why would I want to see him?</i>

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.500
<i>Why would I want to be with him?</i>

00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:11.390
<i>Think harder...</i>

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:16.730
<i>Why did I cry if I didn't dislike it?</i>

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:17.680
<i>You can do it!</i>

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:20.470
<i>Why would I want to know why he kissed me?</i>

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:22.710
<i>Come on, me! You can do it!</i>

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:25.990
<i>What did I want to know?</i>

00:08:25.990 --> 00:08:27.020
<i>You're doing fine...</i>

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:28.890
<i>What did I want him to say?</i>

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:32.810
<i>How do I feel about him?</i>

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:35.100
<i>You're almost there...</i>

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:37.400
<i>Just a little further.</i>

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.030
<i>Maybe I...</i>

00:08:41.090 --> 00:08:42.860
<i>...for Hashiba-kun,</i>

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:44.650
<i>...I'm in love.</i>

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:45.950
<i>He kissed me.</i>

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:48.080
<i>And that made me happy.</i>

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:51.030
<i>I had hope for what his reason would be.</i>

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:55.700
<i>But... he doesn't remember doing it.</i>

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:59.510
<i>Even though it made me sad, I can't just hate him for it.</i>

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:01.130
<i>That's why I cried.</i>

00:09:02.360 --> 00:09:04.430
<i>It's fun being with all of them.</i>

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:06.520
<i>But...</i>

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:08.490
<i>When Hashiba-kun is there,</i>

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:09.850
<i>it's even more fun.</i>

00:09:10.870 --> 00:09:14.010
<i>When he's with me, my heart beats wildly.</i>

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:16.480
<i>I want to be with him even more.</i>

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:20.720
<i>Looking back, during our
summer break and the school fair,</i>

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:23.280
<i>I had so many chances to realize I was in love.</i>

00:09:23.850 --> 00:09:26.360
<i>How did I never notice?</i>

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:29.620
I'm sure yours is still to come.

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:31.810
<i>Hashiba-kun...</i>

00:09:31.810 --> 00:09:34.340
<i>I've found mine!</i>

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:40.500
Good morning.

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:41.250
Morning.

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:43.500
Good morning, Mari-chan.

00:09:44.840 --> 00:09:46.090
Good morning, Anna!

00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:48.420
How are you feeling now?

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:50.560
Really great.

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:57.330
Yeah! It's like you're suddenly worry-free!

00:09:57.330 --> 00:09:59.650
I'd been overthinking things.

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:01.840
But I'm fine now.

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:03.320
That's great!

00:10:06.940 --> 00:10:08.920
The school is the same as always.

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:09.780
<i>And yet...</i>

00:10:10.220 --> 00:10:12.160
<i>...the scenery looks completely different.</i>

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:16.370
<i>It's incredible how much it changes things.</i>

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:19.540
<i>I want to see his face soon.</i>

00:10:20.190 --> 00:10:22.460
<i>I wonder where he is?</i>

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:25.720
<i>Thinking about him makes me so restless.</i>

00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:28.470
<i>But it's fun.</i>

00:10:28.820 --> 00:10:30.430
<i>So this is what it's like.</i>

00:10:30.430 --> 00:10:31.600
Oh!

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:33.640
Kobayakawa-san!

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:34.890
Heading to class?

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:39.730
Yeah. Reading.

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:40.970
<i>There he is!</i>

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:42.520
We've got P.E.

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:44.390
<i>I've found him!</i>

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:45.300
Oh, right!

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:46.150
Did you get my texts?

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:48.360
Yeah, I did.

00:10:48.360 --> 00:10:49.820
I'm better now, thanks.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.260
Thank goodness!

00:10:52.260 --> 00:10:53.240
<i>I'm so happy.</i>

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:55.950
Thank you for worrying about me.

00:10:55.950 --> 00:10:58.660
Your clover picture did help to cheer me up.

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:02.710
Really?! I've been worried that
I might've jumped to conclusions...

00:11:02.710 --> 00:11:04.500
I thought that after I sent it.

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:08.330
Anna... hurry up, or else
there won't be any seats left.

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:08.930
Okay.

00:11:09.590 --> 00:11:10.790
See you later.

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:12.850
Okay. Bye bye.

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:19.100
<i>I've still only just discovered Hashiba-kun.</i>

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:22.650
<i>So I'll keep that kiss as my secret.</i>

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:24.570
<i>Along with...</i>

00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:28.340
<i>...my first love.</i>
